{"data": [{"id": "2121979633143001357", "author_id": "1941552475242106881", "text": "@UPing123zzz i’m a ceng student.\ni created a from-scratch ai + robotics learning path repo to build a solid foundation in the age of AI.\nit covers mathematics → ml/dl → vision → slam → robotics → uav systems.\nthose who want to progress together can star it\nhttps://t.co/lr3B1ZibvN", "created_at": "2026-11-15T14:52:23.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/emrevaltn/status/2121979633143001357", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121902834744791119", "author_id": "1878345967780646912", "text": "@Daibw24 是的，还是要自己去全面的跑一下。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:47:13.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/UPing123zzz/status/2121902834744791119", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121898593196159192", "author_id": "2062437407174381568", "text": "@UPing123zzz 同样权重不同平台差这么多，普通人最直观的感受就是：同样的提示词，这家快、那家慢，账单还不一样。Benchmark 看着热闹，不如自己跑一轮实在。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:30:22.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Daibw24/status/2121898593196159192", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121889813817123143", "author_id": "957615770820751360", "text": "@UPing123zzz 说到点子上了——同一个模型换个推理平台，首字延迟和并发能差好几倍，很多人只盯着模型 Benchmark，忽略了这层。Groq 的 LPU 就是个例子，同样的开源模型在上面跑起来体感完全不一样。你平时压测平台主要看哪几个指标，首字延迟还是每秒 token？", "created_at": "2026-11-15T08:55:29.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/tokenseller/status/2121889813817123143", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121883918584709323", "author_id": "965707616843370497", "text": "@UPing123zzz 同一份权重，KV cache 和 batching 调没调好，账单能差出一截", "created_at": "2026-11-15T08:32:03.000Z", "url":